  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "As clones fight below them at about thirty percent of rank eight strength, Heavenly Lord Bai Zu tells Yao Huang he made that immortal killer move while attacking Hei Fan grotto-heaven. He names Longevity Heaven’s Perfect Pair from Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable as the fuller standard his own method cannot match.",
      "chapters": [
        1235
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_heavenly_lord_bai_zu",
        "char_yao_huang",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "loc_hei_fan_grotto_heaven",
        "fac_longevity_heaven",
        "char_thieving_heaven_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Heavenly Court, Bing Sai Chuan says Mao Li Qiu is using Perfect Pair, a Thieving Heaven method Longevity Heaven sought with great effort, to summon a clone with the same battle strength as the main body.",
      "chapters": [
        1712
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battlefield-clone",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "char_bing_sai_chuan",
        "char_mao_li_qiu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later treats that equal-strength clone as a double amplification, and judges Heroes Among People more profound because it amplifies the main body by at least three times instead of adding one such clone.",
      "chapters": [
        1724
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battlefield-clone",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "move_heroes_among_people"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Court Gu Immortals finally remove Perfect Pair from Mao Li Qiu; four rule path Gu Immortals and Heavenly Court’s records on the move let them decipher it. With the clone gone, Mao Li Qiu can no longer suppress Ruan Dan and Shabi Ninety-five the same way.",
      "chapters": [
        1733
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
